<title>USA: Hibbing ISD 701, Minn., won by Norwest Investment.</title>
<headline>Hibbing ISD 701, Minn., won by Norwest Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Investment said it won $2.200 million of Hibbing ISD 701, Minn., GO school building bonds, Seris 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.231 percent.</p>
</text>
